# 💬 Chatting Application

A real-time one-to-one chatting application built using the **MERN stack** with **Socket.IO** for real-time communication.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

* **React.js** – UI development
* **Vite** – Frontend development/build tool
* **React Router** – Client-side routing
* **Socket.IO Client** – Real-time communication

### Backend

* **Node.js** – Server-side runtime
* **Express.js** – REST API development
* **MongoDB** – Database
* **Mongoose** – MongoDB object modeling
* **Socket.IO** – Real-time messaging
* **JWT** – User authentication
* **bcryptjs** – Password hashing
* **Multer** – File/image uploads
* **Express Validator** – Request validation
* **CORS** – Cross-origin communication

## ✨ Features

* User registration and login
* JWT-based authentication
* One-to-one real-time messaging
* Real-time typing indicator
* Online socket connection handling
* Personal Socket.IO rooms
* Image/file upload support
* Persistent messages using MongoDB

## 📂 Project Structure

```text
